OL,3,GYorkshire
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry to start, with some early
OL,6,Fbright spells, before the cloud
OL,7,Fthickens up during the morning. Rain
OL,8,Fand stronger winds then spread
OL,9,Fnortheast late morning, heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent at times in the afternoon.
OL,11,FGenerally mild. Maximum Temperature
OL,12,F12C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThe rain and cloud clearing
OL,15,Fnorthwards during the evening with
OL,16,Fwinds becoming strong. A generally
OL,17,Fdry, cool night following with some
OL,18,Fclear spells and winds easing slightly
OL,19,F. Minimum Temperature 5C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
