OL,3,GYorkshire
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FSome rain likely around dawn
OL,6,Fbut then mostly dry with good spells
OL,7,Fof sunshine and fresh winds
OL,8,Fcontinuing. A few showers possible in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon with winds easing later
OL,10,Fon. Maximum Temperature 12C.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,13,Frain and very strong winds expected on
OL,14,FTuesday. Mostly dry on Wednesday but
OL,15,Fstaying windy. Thursday seeing lighter
OL,16,Fwinds but a risk of rain. Temperatures
OL,17,Faverage or slightly above.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
